# Release-only app rules. AGP 9.3 includes the default Android optimization rules.
# AndroidX, Hilt, Ktor, Coroutines, Serialization, Coil, OkHttp, ML Kit and Naver
# Maps ship their required consumer rules, including reflection and JNI entry points.

# Kakao's documented model-field rule; its SDK consumer rules keep lifecycle hooks.
# https://developers.kakao.com/docs/ko/android/getting-started#proguard
-keep class com.kakao.sdk.**.model.* { <fields>; }
